/*
Problem: 4Sum
Platform: LeetCode
Difficulty: Medium
Link: https://leetcode.com/problems/4sum/

Approach:
Sort the array → fix first 2 numbers using i and j →
use two pointers for the remaining 2 numbers.

If sum < target → left++
If sum > target → right--
If sum == target → store answer and move both pointers.

Mistakes:
1. Need to skip duplicates for i and j.
2. Need to skip duplicates for left and right after finding an answer.
3. Use long long for sum because int can overflow with large values.

Important:
4Sum = Fix 2 numbers + Two Pointers + Skip duplicates.

Time: O(n^3)
Space: O(1) extra
*/
